      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Williamstown (VIC)**, there are several locksmiths that service the area:\n\n- SMART LOCK INSTALLATION – Mobile locksmith with 24/7 availability and strong customer ratings.\n- MB Locksmiths Melbourne – Installs smart locks and provides residential locksmith services across Melbourne's western suburbs.\n- Five Star Locksmiths | Locksmiths Melbourne – Offers smart lock installation and extended operating hours.\n- Citywest Locksmiths – Specifically advertises locksmith services in Williamstown, including digital locks and access control. [citywestlocksmiths.com.au](https://citywestlocksmiths.com.au/locksmiths-williamstown/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Direct Locksmiths – Lists Williamstown as a service area and provides lock installation and rekeying. [www.directlocksmiths.com.au](https://www.directlocksmiths.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nTypical pricing in Melbourne is approximately:\n- **Straightforward installation:** A$250–A$400 (labour only, if you already have the lock).\n- **Supply and installation:** Around A$400–A$900+, depending on the smart lock model and whether the door requires modifications. [www.armadalelocksmiths.com](https://www.armadalelocksmiths.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you haven't purchased a lock yet, I can also recommend models that suit:\n- Apple HomeKit\n- Google Home\n- Samsung SmartThings\n- Fingerprint + keypad access\n- Rental properties (no drilling or minimal modifications)\n\nJust let me know what type of door you have (timber, aluminium, or security screen) and whether you already own a smart lock.",
